gpio: cadence: enforce Sky1 ACPI pad ownership

Describe the sparse relationship between every Sky1 ACPI GPIO controller
and its main or S5 pin controller. Route GPIO request and free through the
generic pinctrl ownership helpers before changing the Cadence bypass state,
and make Sky1 mux ownership strict. Peripheral and GPIO consumers then use
the firmware-described pinctrl core without silently stealing pads. The two
Both GPIO views of the S5 multifunction pads use the same ownership rule.

